{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","src":"manifest","doc":"ApplicationLevelErrorHandling","page":69,"text":"2 P_ACTIVE\n\nP_TERMINATING\nAn event has occurred that initiates the termination of a partition:\n The OS receives PRO_TERMINATEAPPL_RESTART from a\ncall to the Protection Hook.\n A call to TerminateApplication() is made with parameter set\nto RESTART.\nThe OS triggers the OSRestartTask. In that task, all actions\nnecessary for terminating the partition are initiated.\nNote: The OS cannot distinguish between this transition and the\ntransition P_ACTIVE  P_RESTARTING. This distinction needs to\nbe communicated to the OSRestartTask by other means.","caption":"2 P_ACTIVE ","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["4.0.3"],"page":69,"hash":"7187b05be5e40152","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/e536d84315e4/page_69.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["4.1.3"],"page":69,"hash":"10cbd0a447828b69","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/b42b15082ba4/page_69.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["4.2.2"],"page":69,"hash":"19cc85cc56cf7fcc","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/d98d24b5943d/page_69.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["4.3.1"],"page":68,"hash":"b725e6465b7d035e","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/4d3c44bf66ba/page_68.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["R19-11"],"page":68,"hash":"dffeefee721c5f66","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/770ed3b7847f/page_68.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["R20-11"],"page":68,"hash":"877bdb42bebe5a2e","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/c